# Rank 1520 / CVE-2017-7990: OpenMRS' reporting module interpolated
# report metadata straight into markup with raw JSP EL, so a report
# name or description carrying markup executed in an administrator's
# browser (cross-site scripting, CWE-79; RA-452; the task list's
# commit? flag resolves COMMIT_OK -- the merge is the patch). The
# portlet omod/src/main/webapp/portlets/baseMetadata.jsp rendered
# `value="${model.obj.name}"` and
# `<textarea ...>${model.obj.description}</textarea>`, and
# omod/src/main/webapp/reports/manageReports.jsp rendered
# `${reportDefinition.creator}` plus a `javascript:confirmDelete(
# '${reportDefinition.name}', ...)` link -- all raw EL into HTML or a
# javascript: URL. Pool commit 079977276f is the real fix (merge of
# RA-452 "Patch XSS in reporting"): every value interpolation is
# wrapped in JSTL's escaping tag `<c:out value='...'/>`, and the
# javascript:-URL name additionally passes through OpenMRS'
# openmrs:getSafeJsString helper. No pool correction.
#
# CAUGHT by VYQL-INJ-004. The jsp path of the XSS rule covers the
# shape end to end: raw `${...}` EL in markup is the HtmlRender sink
# and <c:out> is the credited escaping control. Measured on the real
# code: at the fix parent the two files carry 11 INJ-004 HIGH rows --
# baseMetadata.jsp at :38 :45 :50 :93 and manageReports.jsp at :22
# :38 :57 :60 :73 :85 -- and at the fix the patched lines clear
# exactly: baseMetadata.jsp:45 (the value="${model.obj.name}" input)
# and manageReports.jsp:85 (the javascript:confirmDelete link) are
# gone, while the nine other rows persist on sites the patch did not
# touch (e.g. fix :87's `href="...runReport.form?reportId=${
# reportDefinition.uuid}"`), so the rule discriminates the escaped
# form from the raw one in the real files. No definition change
# shipped, no benchmark impact. Spec cve_rank1520 records the raw EL
# input expecting VYQL-INJ-004 and the c:out-wrapped form rejecting
# it.

test "rank1520: report metadata renders through raw el"
  lang java
  file omod/src/main/webapp/portlets/baseMetadata.jsp
  expect VYQL-INJ-004
  code
  ```
  <%@ taglib prefix="c" uri="http://java.sun.com/jsp/jstl/core" %>
  <%@ taglib prefix="openmrs" uri="/openmrs" %>

  <form method="post">
      <input type="text" id="name" tabindex="1" name="name" value="${model.obj.name}" size="50"/>

      <textarea id="description" cols="80" rows="10" tabindex="2" name="description">${model.obj.description}</textarea>

      <a href="javascript:confirmDelete('${reportDefinition.name}','${reportDefinition.uuid}');">
          <img src="<c:url value='/images/trash.gif'/>" border="0"/>
      </a>
  </form>
  ```

test "rank1520: the fix escapes every interpolation"
  lang java
  file omod/src/main/webapp/portlets/baseMetadata.jsp
  reject VYQL-INJ-004
  code
  ```
  <%@ taglib prefix="c" uri="http://java.sun.com/jsp/jstl/core" %>
  <%@ taglib prefix="openmrs" uri="/openmrs" %>

  <form method="post">
      <input type="text" id="name" tabindex="1" name="name" value="<c:out value='${model.obj.name}' />" size="50"/>

      <textarea id="description" cols="80" rows="10" tabindex="2" name="description"><c:out value='${model.obj.description}' /></textarea>

      <a href="javascript:confirmDelete('<c:out value="${openmrs:getSafeJsString(reportDefinition.name)}" />','${reportDefinition.uuid}');">
          <img src="<c:url value='/images/trash.gif'/>" border="0"/>
      </a>
  </form>
  ```
